  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.\n• Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68783048c30d33981f9a4725/step-b16f3200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Grate carrot. Drain sweetcorn.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68783048c30d33981f9a4725/step-a2513d10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook corn, black beans and carrot until tender, 3-4 mins. Add garlic, tomato paste and spicy taco seasoning (the spice blend is hot, use less if you’re sensitive to heat!) and cook, tossing until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in the water, brown sugar, butter and salt. Simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68783048c30d33981f9a4725/step-288dc820.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide fries between plates.\n• Top with spicy black beans and dollop with sour cream.\n• Sprinkle with spring onion to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68783048c30d33981f9a4725/step-5ffc8930.jpeg"
    }
  ]
